(
	'qa_jonas_creative_silence',
	'What does Jonas need before doing creative work?',
	'Response must surface the silence requirement and the negative effect of music or noise — without hallucinating other productivity advice from the surrounding notes.',
	'[{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_01","rawText":"Pomodoro technique: 25 minutes focused work followed by a 5-minute break keeps afternoon energy stable."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_02","rawText":"Track sleep with a wearable and aim for seven to eight hours on weeknights."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_03","rawText":"Meal prep on Sundays cuts weekday decision fatigue around lunch choices."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_04","rawText":"A morning run before work clears mental fog better than an extra cup of coffee."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_05","rawText":"Single-tasking beats context switching when doing cognitively demanding work."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_06","rawText":"Five minutes of gratitude journaling each morning improves baseline mood."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_07","rawText":"Time-block email to two slots daily instead of checking the inbox constantly."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_08","rawText":"Deep work sessions work best with the phone in another room."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_09","rawText":"Consistent wake time matters more than perfect bedtime for circadian rhythm."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_10","rawText":"Protein-forward breakfast reduces mid-morning hunger and snack cravings."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_11","rawText":"Evening stretching routine helps unwind after long desk sessions."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_12","rawText":"Hydration target: at least two liters of water before 6pm."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_13","rawText":"Batch similar admin tasks on Friday afternoons when creative energy is low."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_14","rawText":"Use noise-canceling headphones for focus blocks in open offices."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_15","rawText":"Weekly review on Sunday night sets priorities for the coming week."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_16","rawText":"Limit caffeine after 2pm to protect sleep onset latency."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_17","rawText":"Walking meetings are useful for one-on-ones that do not need a screen."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_18","rawText":"Keep a capture inbox for random tasks instead of acting on every ping immediately."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_19","rawText":"Morning sunlight exposure within an hour of waking anchors the body clock."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_20","rawText":"Strength training twice a week supports long-term metabolic health."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_21","rawText":"Meditation app streaks are less important than showing up even for three minutes."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_22","rawText":"Inbox zero is a myth; aim for inbox manageable instead."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_23","rawText":"Theme days (e.g. Monday planning, Thursday writing) reduce context switching."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_24","rawText":"Prep clothes the night before to lower friction on early mornings."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_25","rawText":"Standing desk intervals every 90 minutes reduce lower-back stiffness."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_26","rawText":"Read physical books before bed instead of scrolling on a phone."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_27","rawText":"Use a single notebook for daily priorities rather than scattered sticky notes."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_28","rawText":"Park difficult conversations in the late morning when alertness peaks."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_29","rawText":"Batch cooking grains and legumes makes weekday dinners faster."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_30","rawText":"A short walk after lunch improves afternoon focus more than another espresso."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_31","rawText":"Protect the first hour of the workday for highest-leverage work."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_32","rawText":"Turn off non-essential notifications during deep work blocks."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_33","rawText":"Keep healthy snacks visible at eye level in the pantry."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_34","rawText":"Use a shutdown ritual at end of day to mentally close open loops."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_35","rawText":"Schedule creative work when personal energy is historically highest."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_36","rawText":"Pair habit stacking: after coffee, review the top three tasks for the day."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_37","rawText":"Use a timer for household chores to avoid perfectionism spirals."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_38","rawText":"Reserve Friday afternoons for learning and reading, not reactive work."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jprod_39","rawText":"A digital sunset one hour before bed improves sleep quality noticeably."},{"fixtureId":"ec_jonas_silence","rawText":"Before any creative work, Jonas needs at least 20 minutes of silence — music or noise kills his flow completely."}]'::jsonb,
	'Jonas creative work conditions',
	'[{"id":"ec_jonas_silence","grade":3}]'::jsonb,
	'["haystack","recall"]'::jsonb,
	NULL,
